    "chunk_text": "\ufffdfter diastole; & he h\u00e6f\u00f0 anes trendles d\u00e6l, & he by\u00f0 \u00feus gesceapen, & he Dasia nys na to forgitanne. He ys \u00feus geciged: aspiratio, \u00fe\u00e6t ys. Gif he ahwar by\u00f0 forgyten \u00fe\u00e6r he beon sceolde, \u00feonne sceal man hine \u00feus amearkian, & eft, gif he Asteriscus ys namcu\u00f0 tacen \u00fe\u00e6t man sett forwel oft on halgum bocum, gif \u00fe\u00e6r hw\u00e6t by\u00f0 forl\u00e6ten, On Greciscre spr\u00e6ce, steorra ys aster genemned. Obelus nys na to forl\u00e6tanne, for\u00feon Hieronymus his wel gymde, swa \u00feu, la cleric, on \u00feam Saltere Lymniscus ys seo gyrd \u00fee by\u00f0 betwyx \u00feam twam pricon, \u00feus licgende. He by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r oft gesett \u00fe\u00e6r halige gewritu beo\u00f0 mid anum andgite gesett & na mid gelicum wordum Antigraphus by\u00f0 \u00feus gemet. He by\u00f0 oft gesett on mislicum gesetnyssum. Paragraphus ys \u00feus amearcod, & oft mid \u00feissum tacne man totw\u00e6m\u00f0 mislice gesetnyssa. Positura ys swylc taken swylce ic her amearkige. \u00deis hiw ys \u00feam o\u00f0rum be d\u00e6le gelic & be d\u00e6le ungelic; eallswa \u00fe\u00e6t ufere taken amearca\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ne Criphia nys na to forgytanne. He ys \u00feus geswutelod: & he by\u00f0 gesett \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fea deopan \u00feing beo\u00f0 unwrogene. Antisimma ys \u00feus gecy\u00f0ed: & he by\u00f0 gesett to \u00feam uersum, \u00fee heora endebyrdnys by\u00f0 awend. Antisimma cum puncto, id est mid prican, by\u00f0 gesett,",
